Bundled code

* Arlet Ottens' 6502 core is in third_party/6502/. The upstream
  permission and copyright notice is in cpu.v. Provenance is in
  third_party/6502/README.md.
* Claire Xenia Wolf's PicoRV32 core is in third_party/picorv32.v
  and carries its ISC license and copyright notice.
* sim/formal/BbcCpuColdBaseline.v derives from Arlet Ottens' core
  and retains its upstream notice.

External inputs

The preparation tools download reference implementations, the Elite-A
disc and BBC ROMs into build/. Their pins are in
tools/validation/reference.lock.json and tools/bbc/reference/lock.json.

David Braben, Ian Bell and Angus Duggan created Elite and Elite-A.
The original game, ROMs, extracted game data and artwork remain
subject to their respective owners' terms.
